type: dataset
title: "Construction Placement Pay Index (Amundson Group)"
abstract: "Median base salary at placement for US construction roles, from the placement records of Amundson Group, a construction-only recruiting firm headquartered in Houston, Texas. Dated monthly releases covering heavy civil, site development, paving, data center, rail, tunnel, wastewater and underground utility construction: medians and quartiles by role, state and metro cuts, and moves since the previous release. Base salary only."
